{
  "info": {
    "name": "KSA — Wallet Transaction Limits (Admin)",
    "description": "Wallet **transaction (spend) limits** — daily / monthly / yearly — with the **customer requests → admin approves** workflow.\n\n## Two tokens\n- **`{{customerToken}}`** (role `customer`) — used for the USER-side endpoints: view my limits, request a limit increase, list my requests. Set by **`0b. Login (Customer)`**.\n- **`{{adminToken}}`** (role `super_admin`) — collection default; used for the ADMIN-side endpoints: platform bounds, list pending, approve, reject. Set by **`0a. Login (Admin)`**.\n\nThe customer raises the request; the admin decides it. Each side carries its own token, exactly like production.\n\n## Flow (run top→bottom)\n1. `0a` admin login, `0b` customer login\n2. Admin sets MIN/MAX bounds (daily+monthly+yearly)\n3. Customer views limits + usage (BEFORE)\n4. **Customer requests a limit increase** → captures `{{lastLimitRequestId}}`\n5. Customer lists their requests / Admin lists PENDING\n6. **Admin approves** → new limits applied to the wallet (or rejects)\n7. Customer views limits again (AFTER → reflects approved limits)\n\nEnforcement: transfers + withdrawals exceeding the cumulative daily / monthly / yearly limit are blocked with `WALLET.BALANCE.LIMIT_EXCEEDED`.\n\n`{{walletId}}` is owned by the customer `{{customerEmail}}` so the request is for their own wallet. Swap all three (`walletId`, `customerEmail`, `customerPin`) to target a different customer.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{adminToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://46.62.226.94:8000/wallet-service",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "wallet-service via Kong. Use http://localhost:8000/wallet-service for local."
    },
    {
      "key": "identityUrl",
      "value": "http://46.62.226.94:8000/identity-service",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "adminToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "super_admin JWT — auto-set by '0a. Login (Admin)'"
    },
    {
      "key": "customerToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "customer JWT — auto-set by '0b. Login (Customer)'"
    },
    {
      "key": "customerEmail",
      "value": "foreign-test12354666@example.com",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Owner of {{walletId}} (Foreign/email onboarding flow)"
    },
    {
      "key": "customerPin",
      "value": "147852",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "6-digit onboarding PIN for {{customerEmail}}"
    },
    {
      "key": "tenantId",
      "value": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "walletId",
      "value": "e12a1d87-859f-42c7-b341-02aec6276c9e",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "ACTIVE wallet owned by {{customerEmail}}"
    },
    {
      "key": "lastLimitRequestId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "auto-set by 'Request Limit Increase'"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0a. Login (Admin) — auto-sets {{adminToken}}",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
              "  var j = pm.response.json();",
              "  var t = j.data && (j.data.accessToken || j.data.access_token);",
              "  if (t) { pm.collectionVariables.set('adminToken', t); console.log('adminToken set'); }",
              "} else { console.log('admin login failed: ' + pm.response.code); }"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        },
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"superadmin\",\n  \"password\": \"Admin@1234\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{identityUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
          "host": [
            "{{identityUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "v1",
            "auth",
            "login"
          ]
        }
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "0b. Login (Customer) — auto-sets {{customerToken}}",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
              "  var j = pm.response.json();",
              "  var t = j.data && (j.data.accessToken || j.data.access_token);",
              "  if (t) { pm.collectionVariables.set('customerToken', t); console.log('customerToken set'); }",
              "} else { console.log('customer login failed: ' + pm.response.code); }"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        },
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{customerEmail}}\",\n  \"pin\": \"{{customerPin}}\"\n}",
